  "decisions": [
    "Rotate all 110 tower mesh objects together, including separate interior/window/floor hardware groups; compose their existing transforms.",
    "Remove inferred south stair and obstructing landing rail; retain other FootTown facade geometry.",
    "Southern apron only; western parking and full city terrain remain outside the corrected grade.",
    "Roof room/equipment dimensions and exact placement are photo-guided estimates.",
    "Provide a checked continuous model passage from the existing stair landing through central wall to the existing passenger-floor ring.",
    "Upper support outer endpoints already lie within 0.018 m of retained tower mesh; visible member widths already overlap steel. No fictitious joint-gap fix.",
    "Unverified upper bay spacing, rescue levels, hidden machinery and elevator motion remain unchanged."
  ],
